tyle=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 3600\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v2400 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-2400 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v2400 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋂</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4382em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 3600\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v2400 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-2400 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v2400 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而放开口径是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>disj</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><munder><mo>⋂</mo><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>∖</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow></munder><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{disj}}(v) = \\left| \\bigcap_{f \\in F \\setminus D} S_f \\cap S_{v} \\right|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.6em;vertical-align:-1.55em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 3600\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v2400 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-2400 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v2400 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∖</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">⋂</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 3600\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v2400 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-2400 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v2400 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>两个式子的差别只在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⋂</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bigcap</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">⋂</span></span></span></span></span> 是否包含 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 自身的已选条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么必须用放开口径\">为什么必须用放开口径</h2><p>直觉上「收紧口径」更符合字面意思——它精确回答「加上耐克之后我还有多少结果」。但它在多值维度上会立刻产生荒谬的结果。</p>\n<p>假设用户在品牌维度已经勾了「耐克」，现在面板上每个其他品牌的后缀数字会用收紧口径算成 0：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>conj</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>阿迪达斯</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>brand=nike</mtext></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>brand=adidas</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">∣</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{conj}}(\\text{阿迪达斯}) = \\left| S_{\\text{brand=nike}} \\cap S_{\\text{brand=adidas}} \\right| = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">conj</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">阿迪达斯</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">brand=nike</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">brand=adidas</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">∣</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>因为品牌维度是单值互斥的（一个商品通常只有一个品牌），任何其他品牌与耐克的交集都是空集。用户看到的是「阿迪达斯 (0)」，而且是灰的、不可点的。但他明明只是想从耐克<strong>换成</strong>阿迪达斯。这就是收紧口径在 OR 语义维度上的致命缺陷：<strong>它把同维度内本应是 OR 的关系错误地按 AND 计算了</strong>。</p>\n<p>放开口径则给出正确结果：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>brand=adidas</mtext></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>other</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert S_{\\text{brand=adidas}} \\cap S_{\\text{other}} \\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">brand=adidas</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">other</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，即「在其余条件不变的前提下，选阿迪达斯会有多少结果」。这正是用户想知道的。</p>\n<p>因此规则可以概括为一句话：<strong>某个维度内候选值的 count，必须在不含该维度约束的条件下计算</strong>。对每个维度分别计算一份聚合，这是「disjunctive faceting」的标准含义，也是 Solr 的 <code>facet.ex</code>（facet exclusion）、Elasticsearch 的 <code>post_filter</code> + 不带该 filter 的聚合、以及各类检索 SDK 提供的 facet 排除机制的共同目标。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[已选条件: brand=nike, color=red] --&gt; B[并发发起聚合计算]&#10;  B --&gt; C[聚合 brand: 排除 brand 约束&lt;br/&gt;color=red 生效]&#10;  B --&gt; D[聚合 color: 排除 color 约束&lt;br/&gt;brand=nike 生效]&#10;  B --&gt; E[聚合 price: 排除 price 约束&lt;br/&gt;brand+color 生效]&#10;  C --&gt; F[合并为一份 facet 响应]&#10;  D --&gt; F&#10;  E --&gt; F&#10;  F --&gt; G[渲染面板: 每个值带放开口径 count]\">graph TD\n  A[已选条件: brand=nike, color=red] --&gt; B[并发发起聚合计算]\n  B --&gt; C[聚合 brand: 排除 brand 约束&lt;br/&gt;color=red 生效]\n  B --&gt; D[聚合 color: 排除 color 约束&lt;br/&gt;brand=nike 生效]\n  B --&gt; E[聚合 price: 排除 price 约束&lt;br/&gt;brand+color 生效]\n  C --&gt; F[合并为一份 facet 响应]\n  D --&gt; F\n  E --&gt; F\n  F --&gt; G[渲染面板: 每个值带放开口径 count]</pre><h2 id=\"服务端如何实现-facet-排除\">服务端如何实现 facet 排除</h2><p>三种主流检索栈的实现路径不同，成本也不一样。</p>\n<p><strong>Elasticsearch</strong>：不要用 <code>query</code> 里的 <code>bool.filter</code> 承载筛选条件，改用 <code>post_filter</code> 承载它们，然后每个 facet 聚合里用 <code>filter</code> 子聚合显式排除自身维度。或者更直接的方式是在 <code>aggs</code> 里为每个维度写一个带 <code>bool.must_not</code> 的 <code>filter</code> 聚合。前者在结果集较小时更省，后者更直白可控。需要警惕的是 <code>post_filter</code> 会改变分页总数与聚合基数，配合 <code>track_total_hits</code> 使用时必须确认总数口径。</p>\n<p><strong>Solr</strong>：用 <code>facet.ex</code> 或 <code>fq={!tag=brand}brand:nike</code> 的标签-排除语法，一次请求就能返回所有维度的放开口径聚合，是这类需求里最省事的实现。</p>\n<p><strong>自建检索 / 向量检索</strong>：如果主召回是向量相似度，facet 聚合通常要另走一条结构化索引（倒排或列存）来计算。关键在于这条结构化通道能独立于向量召回去掉某个维度的约束，否则放开口径无法实现，就只能退化成全集口径——那是明显更差的体验。</p>\n<p>无论哪条路径，都要注意<strong>聚合结果集的口径一致性</strong>：count 应该基于「当前查询词 + 除本维度外的全部筛选」，而不是「当前查询词」。查询词是用户意图的一部分，不参与维度排除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前端该做什么-不该做什么\">前端该做什么、不该做什么</h2><p>前端在这件事上的职责是<strong>消费与呈现</strong>，不是计算。任何一个试图在客户端计算 count 的方案（例如拿到全量结果自己数）都会在结果集超过一页时失效——分页返回的只是当前页，用它统计出的 count 只能反映这一页。</p>\n<p>前端真正要处理的是三类边界情况。</p>\n<p><strong>值的 count 为零</strong>。这时该候选值应该置灰还是保留可点？推荐<strong>保留可点但视觉弱化</strong>，除非它是同维度内第一个被选的。理由：置灰会让用户困惑（为什么这个品牌一个结果都没有？），而在放开口径下 count=0 只表示「在当前其他条件下，这个值确实无结果」——可能正是用户想验证的假设。还有一层考虑：如果因为推荐算法把长尾品牌排到后面，用户本来就不会点，置灰反而给了它额外的视觉噪音。折中做法是保留可点但降低不透明度，并在 hover 时给出「当前条件下无匹配」的提示。</p>\n<p><strong>已选值的 count</strong>。已选中的值在放开口径下拿到的是「如果不选它会有多少」，这个数字对用户没有意义（他已经选了）。因此<strong>已选值不显示 count</strong>，或者显示的是「其余条件 + 该值」的收紧口径 count 用于确认。两种做法都有站点在用，但一致的原则是：同一维度内，已选与未选值的 count 语义必须能自圆其说，不能出现「已选的 128 和未选的 128 含义不同却不加说明」。</p>\n<p><strong>维度整体无有效候选</strong>。当某个维度在放开口径下所有值的 count 都是 0（例如当前价格区间的商品全都不属于任何已配置品牌），这个维度应该隐藏。但它不能被静默隐藏——如果这个维度里有已选值，隐藏就没法取消。正确做法是保留维度并显示「当前条件下无匹配」，同时把已选值的 × 保留可点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合响应与筛选态的竞态\">聚合响应与筛选态的竞态</h2><p>放开口径的实现天然需要更重的服务端计算（每个维度一份聚合），响应时间比普通查询长。这带来一个前端必须处理的竞态：<strong>用户在聚合还没返回时就又勾了一个条件</strong>。</p>\n<p>三条原则：</p>\n<p>第一，<strong>聚合与列表可以分开发、分别更新</strong>。列表结果用来更新可见的结果卡片，聚合结果用来更新面板数字。用户对列表的延迟更敏感，对面板数字的延迟容忍度高得多。允许聚合晚于列表到达，能让首屏结果更快出现，代价是面板数字短暂停留在旧值。</p>\n<p>第二，<strong>过期聚合必须被丢弃</strong>。每次请求带一个单调递增的序号或时间戳，响应回来时若序号不是最新，直接丢弃。这比 <code>AbortController</code> 更稳妥，因为聚合请求可能在列表请求之外独立发出，且有时用户希望旧的列表结果留在屏幕上（避免闪烁），只是不接受旧的数字。</p>\n<p>第三，<strong>数字更新时避免&quot;跳变&quot;</strong>。如果每次勾选所有维度的数字都立刻重排（因为 count 变了，按 count 排序的列表顺序也变了），用户的视线会被打乱——他刚想点第三项，列表因为 count 变化重排了，点到了第四项。这是筛选面板里最隐蔽的可用性缺陷。</p>\n<p>缓解方案是：<strong>排序键只在面板初次加载或维度展开时确定一次，后续 count 更新只改数字、不改顺序</strong>。用户主动操作的维度（勾选那个维度本身）可以重排，因为那时他的注意力就在那个维度上。这条规则把「保持稳定」与「反映变化」的冲突限制在了可接受的范围内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个可验证的正确性检查\">一个可验证的正确性检查</h2><p>实现完成后，有一个简单但很有力的检查方法：<strong>勾选某个值，看该值自身的 count 是否保持不变（或按预期变化）</strong>。</p>\n<p>设用户从未筛选状态勾选「耐克」。此时放开口径下，耐克的 count 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>brand=nike</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert S_{\\text{brand=nike}} \\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">brand=nike</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>；勾选后，放开口径仍然排除 brand 维度，所以它还是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>brand=nike</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert S_{\\text{brand=nike}} \\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">brand=nike</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>——<strong>数字应该纹丝不动</strong>。如果它变了，说明实现用的是收紧口径或者排除逻辑写错了。</p>\n<p>再看其他品牌：勾选耐克前，「阿迪达斯」的 count 是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>brand=adidas</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert S_{\\text{brand=adidas}} \\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">brand=adidas</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>；勾选后变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>brand=adidas</mtext></msub><mo>∩</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>other</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">∣</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lvert S_{\\text{brand=adidas}} \\cap S_{\\text{other}} \\rvert</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">brand=adidas</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">other</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">∣</span></span></span></span></span>，而 <code>other</code> 此时为空集（没有别的维度被筛），所以<strong>也是纹丝不动</strong>。</p>\n<p>真正会变的只有<strong>其他维度</strong>的 count。勾选耐克后，价格维度的候选值 count 会全部下降（因为现在只统计耐克的价格分布）。这个「本维度不变、他维度变化」的指纹，是验证放开口径实现是否正确的最快方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三种口径中必须用放开口径（disjunctive）：本维度候选值的 count 在不含本维度约束的条件下计算。</li>\n<li>收紧口径会让同维度其他值全部变 0，与「品牌是 OR」的语义直接冲突，是必须避免的错误。</li>\n<li>服务端实现：ES 用 <code>post_filter</code> 或排除式 filter 聚合，Solr 用 <code>facet.ex</code>，自建检索需要独立的结构化通道。</li>\n<li>前端只消费不计算 count；分页结果无法用于统计。</li>\n<li>count 为零的候选保留可点并弱化视觉；已选值不显示 count；整维度无匹配时保留维度以留出取消入口。</li>\n<li>聚合响应允许晚于列表到达，但必须按序号丢弃过期响应。</li>\n<li>排序键只在初次加载/展开时确定，后续 count 更新不改顺序，避免用户点错。</li>\n<li>正确性指纹：勾选后本维度 count 不变、他维度 count 下降。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"各 facet 候选数实时更新","id":"各-facet-候选数实时更新"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：count 的三种口径","id":"核心概念-count-的三种口径"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么必须用放开口径","id":"为什么必须用放开口径"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端如何实现 facet 排除","id":"服务端如何实现-facet-排除"},{"level":2,"text":"前端该做什么、不该做什么","id":"前端该做什么-不该做什么"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合响应与筛选态的竞态","id":"聚合响应与筛选态的竞态"},{"level":2,"text":"一个可验证的正确性检查","id":"一个可验证的正确性检查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"清空筛选与误触保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/search-filter-sort-experience/selected-conditions/clear-all-undo"},"next":{"title":"排序选项与升降序切换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/search-filter-sort-experience/sort-options/sort-selector"}}